<h2>Pustaka</h2>
<ul>
<li>Bergenholtz, H., Nielsen, S., Tarp, S. (eds.): Lexicography at a Crossroads: Dictionaries and Encyclopedias Today, Lexicographical Tools Tomorrow. Peter Lang 2009. ISBN 978-3-03911-799-4</li>
<li>Higgens, G., ed. (1980) Printed Reference Material (Handbooks on Library Practice.) London: Library Association</li>
<li>Katz, W. A. (1978) Introduction to Reference Work; 3rd ed. 2 vols. New York: McGraw-Hill</li>
